格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Voice input plugin — a mic button in the composer tool row that turns speech into text live via the browser's Web Speech API (Chrome/Edge), with language switching and optional auto-send. Zero dependencies.","id":"gh:1335558973","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-voice-input","slug":"0nt-one/dsh-voice-input","topics":["dsh-plugin","speech-to-text","voice-input"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Voice input plugin — a mic button in the composer tool row that turns speech into text live via the "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"browser's Web Speech API (Chrome/Edge), with language switching and optional auto-send. Zero depende"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"r's Web Speech API (Chrome/Edge), with language switching and optional auto-send. Zero dependencies."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-voice-input-web"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"语音输入客户端插件（client plugin）——给 DeepSeek Harness Web GUI 的聊天输入框工具行加一个**麦克风按钮**：点击开始说话，浏览器 Web Speech API"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"（Chrome / Edge 内置，免费、无需 API 密钥）把语音**实时转成文字填入输入框**。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## 功能"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- 麦克风按钮位于输入框工具行右侧（发送按钮左侧，`conversation.input.right` 插槽）\n- 点击开始/停止聆听；聆听时按钮红色脉冲，上方浮层实时显示转写中间结果\n- 每段识别完"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"成的最终文本自动追加到输入框草稿，可继续编辑后发送\n- 浮层内可一键切换识别语言：中文 / English / 自动\n- 可选自动发送：`localStorage` 设置 `dsh-voice-inp"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ut-web.autoSend = \"1\"` 后，一段语音识别完成即自动发送\n- 零依赖、零密钥、无服务端改动；识别完全在浏览器本地进行"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 与其他方案对比"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| 方案 | 转写方式 | 依赖 | 成本 |\n| :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- |\n| **本插件（Web Speech API）** | 浏览器系统语音服务 | 无 | 免费 |\n|"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" dsh-voice | agent 工具（OpenAI 兼容 ASR） | 需 ASR API key | STT 收费 |\n| dsh-voice-input（SenseVoice） | 本地离线"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"转写 | 需模型/服务 | 免费、离线 |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 方式一：npm 包（推荐）"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 方式二：离线安装（GitHub 源码）"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"1. 将本包放入 web profile 的 node_modules："},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"2. 在 `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` 追加："},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"3. 重启 `dsh --profile web`，浏览器刷新页面。按钮出现在输入框工具行。"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"> 安装后插件 id / 包目录名 / localStorage key 统一使用 `dsh-voice-input-web`（`dsh-voice-input` 在 npm 上已被同名 SenseV"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"/ 包目录名 / localStorage key 统一使用 `dsh-voice-input-web`（`dsh-voice-input` 在 npm 上已被同名 SenseVoice 方案占用）。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 配置（localStorage）"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| key | 值 | 默认 | 说明 |\n| :-- | :-- | :-- | :-- |\n| `dsh-voice-input-web.lang` | `zh-CN` / `en-US` / `"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"auto` | `zh-CN` | 识别语言 |\n| `dsh-voice-input-web.autoSend` | `\"1\"` / `\"0\"` | `\"0\"` | 识别完成后自动发送 |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## 兼容性"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- 需要 **Chrome / Edge**（或任何支持 `webkitSpeechRecognition` 的浏览器）；Firefox 不支持 Web Speech API，会显示提示\n- 页面需在"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" `localhost` / `127.0.0.1` 或 HTTPS 下访问（浏览器安全限制）\n- 语音识别需要联网（由浏览器调用系统语音服务）"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
